---
// Component: LocalCaseStudy.astro
---
<!-- RECENT SECURITY INSTALLATIONS NEAR BRISBANE -->
<section id="projects" class="py-20 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <span class="text-xs font-black text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/50 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-800/50 shadow-2xs">
        Proven Field Track Record
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-3 tracking-tight font-display">
        Recent Security Installations in Brisbane
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 leading-relaxed">
        Real-world project case studies demonstrating how we solve complex cabling, camera coverage, and IT network challenges across Greater Brisbane.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Case Study 1: Carindale Residence -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-800/50 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Residential Home
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">Chermside QLD</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3 font-display">
            Two-Storey Brick Home 6-Camera PoE Retrofit
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Customer needed zero blind spots across double garage, backyard pool area, and front perimeter. Required concealed cabling with no exposed external conduit.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
              <span><strong>Hardware:</strong> 6x Dahua TiOC 6MP Full-Color Turrets</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
              <span><strong>Storage:</strong> 2TB Seagate SkyHawk Surveillance HDD</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
              <span><strong>Execution:</strong> Internal cavity drops, zero external conduit</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">Result:</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">100% Perimeter Protection</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case Study 2: Commercial Office -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/50 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Commercial / Office
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">Fortitude Valley QLD</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3 font-display">
            Medical Clinic Secure Network & Surveillance
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            High privacy compliance requirement. Needed separate VLAN networks for patient medical records and staff Wi-Fi, paired with entrance and waiting room 4K cameras.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>
              <span><strong>Hardware:</strong> 8x Hikvision DarkFighter 4K Dome Cameras</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>
              <span><strong>Network:</strong> Hardware Firewall & Managed VLAN Switch</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>
              <span><strong>Compliance:</strong> Isolated NDA-compliant patient data subnet</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">Result:</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">HIPAA/Australian Privacy Compliant</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case Study 3: Industrial Warehouse -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/50 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Warehouse / Logistics
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">Rocklea QLD</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3 font-display">
            High-Bay Warehouse & Loading Dock Security
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Large 1,200m² industrial building with 8-meter ceilings. Required long-range license plate recognition (LPR) at gate and 24/7 loading bay tracking.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
              <span><strong>Hardware:</strong> 12x Long-Range Varifocal & ANPR Cameras</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
              <span><strong>Storage:</strong> 8TB Redundant RAID Surveillance Array</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
              <span><strong>Access:</strong> Remote multi-site management console</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">Result:</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Zero Inventory Shrinkage</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
